  "description": "Given an integer array nums of length n, return the maximum value of F(0), F(1), ..., F(n-1) where F(k) = 0*nums[k] + 1*nums[k+1] + ... + (n-1)*nums[k+n-1].",
  "target": 26,
  "pseudocode": "1: let sum = nums.reduce((a, b) => a + b)\n2: let F = nums.reduce((a, b, i) => a + i * b, 0)\n3: let maxF = F\n4: for i = nums.length - 1 down to 1:\n5:   F = F + sum - nums.length * nums[i]\n6:   maxF = max(maxF, F)",
